    {
      "kind": "takeaways",
      "heading": "The short version",
      "html": "<ul><li>The visual inspection comes before testing. It uses your eyes only.</li><li>The checklist follows BS 7671 Regulation 641.1 and IET Guidance Note 3.</li><li>The visual record has words and codes. The test schedule has numbers.</li><li>A full EICR needs both.</li><li>Quickler turns spoken observations into a written record.</li><li>You decide the codes. Quickler does not.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
